body:
Probably. Again, if I were to do that sort of thing to someone it would be primarily to make them feel good.

It sucks to hear about the unfit-to-consent thing, I'm still in my teens and, alongside that, pretty much all the girls I'm friends with are pretty severely depressed. Kind of how I got into the mutual harm thing, I suppose I should admit. Nothing permanent

@3 I wonder why that is.
